'''Stufful''' (Japanese: '''ヌイコグマ''' ''Nuikoguma'') is a {{ct|Colorless}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Extradimensional Crisis}} expansion.

