==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Extradimensional Crisis}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Burning Shadows|Stufful|110}} from the {{TCG|Burning Shadows}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Crimson Invasion|Stufful|55}} from the {{TCG|Crimson Invasion}} expansion.
*'''Ram''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Zubat|70}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

